      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.57 (down from ₹2.28 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹670.3m (up 16% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹15.4m (down 31% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.3% (down from 3.9% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 23% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 4% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
